ghost: ...There you are.
ghost: I felt something stir the moment you crossed into these trees.
if {SoulCoreAwakened} == 1:
	ghost: A Core, freshly woken, still raw at the edges. Yours, now.
	ghost: I carried one like it, once. Long enough to become what you're looking at.
	ghost: Before you go any further, prove the Core chose someone who can carry the weight.
else:
	ghost: Nothing woken yet, but it's in there. Waiting, the way mine did.
	ghost: I won't wait politely. Let's see what you're made of now, while it still sleeps.
[end_timeline]
